# Base URL of the OpenClaw booking API (e.g. an ngrok tunnel during development).
# Leave unset to see the "booking availability isn't connected yet" fallback state on /book.
#
# In Vercel, this is set twice, scoped per environment (Project Settings > Environment
# Variables): the Production value (main branch) points at the real production OpenClaw
# ngrok URL; the Preview value (staging branch + other preview branches) points at the
# staging OpenClaw backend once one exists. See docs/staging-environment.md.
NEXT_PUBLIC_OPENCLAW_URL=
